span>Toggle</span></span></a></div></li></ul></li></ul></nav><div class="documentation-sidebar__version"><a class="documentation-sidebar__link" href="../changelog">v<!-- -->3.4.0</a></div></aside><main class="documentation-sidebar__content"><h1 class="bold" id="tooltip"><a class="underline reset-text-decoration" href="tooltip#tooltip">Tooltip</a></h1>
<p>Tooltip describes an interactive (trigger) element with rich text.
Tooltip is displayed only after explicit trigger activation (click/tap, or keyboard activation of the trigger).
Tooltip is closed when user activates the trigger again, presses <span class="code-wrapper code-container inline" style="background-color:hsl(230, 1%, 98%);color:hsl(230, 8%, 24%)"><code class="code code--inline prism-code language-markup code-inline"><span class="token-line" style="color:hsl(230, 8%, 24%)"><span class="token plain">Esc</span></span></code></span>, or clicks/taps outside of trigger and tooltip dialog.
Clicking inside tooltip dialog does not close it, so users can select tooltip text.</p>
