<h2 class="bold" id="accessibility"><a class="underline reset-text-decoration" href="tooltip#accessibility">Accessibility</a></h2>
<p>The tooltip component is implemented by the incomplete <a href="https://www.w3.org/TR/wai-aria-practices/#tooltip" class="underline">WAI-ARIA authoring practice</a> and <a href="https://inclusive-components.design/tooltips-toggletips/" class="underline">Heydon Pickering</a>&#x27;s <a href="https://inclusive-components.design/tooltips-toggletips/" class="underline">tooltip component</a>.</p>
<p>Notes:</p>
<ul>
<li>The tooltip trigger element uses <span class="code-wrapper code-container inline" style="background-color:hsl(230, 1%, 98%);color:hsl(230, 8%, 24%)"><code class="code code--inline prism-code language-markup code-inline"><span class="token-line" style="color:hsl(230, 8%, 24%)"><span class="token plain">aria-owns</span></span></code></span> attribute to help NVDA speak the description text.</li>
<li>Tooltips with triggers of presentaion role do not announce dialog content in some screenreaders.</li>
